      "text": "Authentication check runs before /save.php writes:\n  1. Request arrives → isAuthenticated() checks cookie\n  2. verifyToken() validates HMAC signature + 30-day age\n  3. If invalid → 401 Unauthorized\n  4. If valid → Bun.write(bookmarks.json, body)\n\nAll non-auth routes require a valid session cookie (HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict).",
